WEBVTT

00:03:59.808 --> 00:04:02.832
si cha faida, na bila malezi,

00:04:02.832 --> 00:04:04.897
Chuo kinachopeana shahada ya digrii

00:04:04.897 --> 00:04:06.784
kupeana mbadala,

00:04:06.784 --> 00:04:10.376
kujenga mbadala kwa wasio na mwingine

00:04:10.376 --> 00:04:13.952
mbadala ulio nafuu

00:04:13.952 --> 00:04:15.841
na wenye kipimo

00:04:15.841 --> 00:04:18.874
mbadala utakao koroga

00:04:18.874 --> 00:04:21.725
mfumo wa elimu wa sasa

00:04:21.725 --> 00:04:23.613
ufungue milango ya elimu ya juu

00:04:23.613 --> 00:04:25.917
kwa mwanafunzi yeyote aliyehitimu

00:04:25.917 --> 00:04:30.553
bila kujali pato lao, wala wanakoishi,